{"id":"en_frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast","title":"Frozen Fortune: The 360K Revenge Toast","titleEn":"Frozen Fortune: The 360K Revenge Toast","description":"She spent a decade growing their fortune, yet her husband's family dismissed her as nothing but a burden. So she filed for divorce. The very next day, they threw a lavish celebration costing 360,000 dollars, and he reached for her card to cover it. What they didn't know was how carefully she had mapped out her departure. The party meant to crown their triumph instead collapsed into a public humiliation. When a wife finally refuses to play along, the question becomes who truly stands to lose everything.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Romantic Marriage","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cwdcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cwdcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cwdcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cwdcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_frozen-fortune-the-360k-revenge-toast_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number